      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "New Purely Inspired 100% Pure Probiotics + Weight Loss combines advanced weight loss with active probiotics, vitamins and minerals and the hottest ingredients including Garcinia cambogia and green tea into one unique formula.\nActive probiotics blend with 1 billion live cultures in every serving\nThis formula includes the active probiotic strains Lactobacillus acidophilus & Bifidobacterium lactis. In addition this formula includes the prebiotic fiber inulin."
